        "message": "V0.3.0 Redis fixes (#19)\n\nFixes\n\nPrevent expired Redis fallback values from reappearing after subsequent writes.\n\nProtect existing PII placeholders from being masked again, fixing corrupted tokens and incomplete restoration in follow-up turns.\n\nApply each Redis hash write and its TTL within one server-side script, preventing interruption between those operations.\n\nReject invalid configuration before loading guard models or executing downstream work.",
